window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>From debut novelist F. L. Morgan, comes <i>The Timeless Bond</i>, a soul-stirring journey through centuries, fate, and forbidden love. Where time is both a gift, and a curse.</p> <p>Nova Andromeda never imagined the mirror in her antique shop would become a doorway to her past. Or that the man waiting on the other side had known her across lifetimes. Haunted by dreams she can’t explain, and a name she’s never heard, <i>Evangeline</i>. Nova is thrust into a reality where time bends, reincarnation is real, and the connection she feels with the mysterious Gabriel is more than just déjà vu... it’s destiny.</p> <p>As Nova uncovers the truth about her origins, she begins to awaken powers that could alter the course of time itself. But with every answer comes a new danger. Especially when the ancient enemy who has hunted her for centuries resurfaces with one goal in mind: to end the lifecycle, forever.</p> <p>From the witch trials of 1693 in Salem, to the quiet corners of modern-day Massachusetts, <i>The Timeless Bond</i> weaves a tale of soulmates torn apart by time, reunited by fate, and determined to reclaim the love that defies death itself.</p> <p>Their story began long before this life. And it won’t end here.</p>"; 
